1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:00,930
Decilo!

2
00:00:01,592 --> 00:00:02,833
Live captions.

3
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:05,107
So no idea gets left out!

4
00:00:06,245 --> 00:00:09,371
Language should never leave you out of a conference!

5
00:00:10,056 --> 00:00:12,054
Decilo transcribes English and Spanish,

6
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:13,830
and translates English into Spanish.

7
00:00:16,246 --> 00:00:17,341
It is this easy!

8
00:00:17,947 --> 00:00:21,776
Paste a link, choose the language and share the tab
audio.

9
00:00:22,456 --> 00:00:24,198
Whisper transcribes on your machine;

10
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:27,658
when the audio is in English, Gemma translates it into
Spanish.

11
00:00:31,245 --> 00:00:34,613
Prefer cloud processing? Choose Gemini.

12
00:00:35,279 --> 00:00:36,697
Audio is transcribed live

13
00:00:36,697 --> 00:00:38,997
and translation appears incrementally,

14
00:00:39,096 --> 00:00:41,598
while the history keeps track of the talk.

15
00:00:46,247 --> 00:00:47,119
And look at this!

16
00:00:47,813 --> 00:00:50,939
Two different talks translated at the same time in the
cloud.

17
00:00:51,608 --> 00:00:54,511
Each session keeps its own audio and captions.

18
00:00:55,168 --> 00:00:58,919
More viewers can follow a session without duplicating
inference.

19
00:01:10,245 --> 00:01:12,434
It also works with talks in Spanish!

20
00:01:13,052 --> 00:01:14,370
We tested local and cloud processing.

21
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:17,897
Here, we show the original transcription.

22
00:01:23,245 --> 00:01:25,969
The browser sends audio to the Python backend.

23
00:01:26,588 --> 00:01:28,698
It selects the local engine or Gemini,

24
00:01:28,786 --> 00:01:30,070
coordinates sessions

25
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:32,415
and distributes captions over WebSocket.

26
00:01:33,072 --> 00:01:35,651
Processing is separate from the audience.

27
00:01:45,245 --> 00:01:46,753
Decilo is open source!

28
00:01:47,427 --> 00:01:49,415
Under the Apache 2.0 license.

29
00:01:50,083 --> 00:01:51,736
Find the code on GitHub.

30
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,600
Try it and join us!
